msgid "Curves"
msgstr "Křivky"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/curves_filter.gd:30
msgid ""
"Map input to output along a curve you draw, over the histogram, per channel "
"or for all channels."
msgstr "Mapovat vstup na výstup podél nakreslené křivky, nad histogramem, pro jednotlivé kanály nebo pro všechny."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/gradient_map/gradient_map_filter.gd:52
msgid "Gradient Map"
msgstr "Mapa přechodu"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/gradient_map/gradient_map_filter.gd:61
msgid ""
"Colour a picture by its lightness: darks take a ramp's first colour, lights "
"its last, midtones what lies between."
msgstr "Obarvit obraz podle jasu: tmavé dostanou první barvu přechodu, světlé poslední, střední tóny to, co leží mezi."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/gradient_map/gradient_map_filter.gd:81
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/levels_filter.gd:88
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/white_point/white_point_filter.gd:138
msgid "Close and leave the layer as it was. The preview goes with it."
msgstr "Zavřít a nechat vrstvu, jak byla. Náhled odejde s ním."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/gradient_map/gradient_map_panel.gd:53
msgid "Reverse"
msgstr "Obrátit směr"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/gradient_map/gradient_map_panel.gd:54
msgid "Swap the dark and the light ends of the ramp."
msgstr "Prohodit tmavý a světlý konec přechodu."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/gradient_map/gradient_map_panel.gd:63
msgid "Lay this gradient across the picked colours, replacing the ramp."
msgstr "Položit tento přechod přes vybrané barvy místo dosavadního."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/hue_saturation_lightness_filter.gd:18
msgid "Hue/Saturation/Lightness"
msgstr "Odstín/sytost/jas"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/hue_saturation_lightness_filter.gd:27
msgid ""
"Turn the hue, scale the colourfulness and lift the lightness, in Oklab so a "
"hue keeps its brightness."
msgstr "Otočit odstín, škálovat barevnost a zvednout jas, v Oklab, aby si odstín držel svůj jas."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/equalize_filter.gd:28
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:238
msgid "Equalize"
msgstr "Vyrovnání"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/equalize_filter.gd:38
msgid ""
"Spread the layer's lightness evenly from black to white, and leave its "
"chroma and hue alone. Opens in Levels, where the handles take it further."
msgstr "Rozprostřít jas vrstvy rovnoměrně od černé po bílou a nechat její sytost a odstín. Otevře se v Úrovních, kde ho úchyty posunou dál."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/levels_filter.gd:46
msgid "Levels"
msgstr "Úrovně"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/levels_filter.gd:56
msgid ""
"Move the input and output black and white points, and the gamma between "
"them, per channel or for all channels. Equalize spreads the lightness evenly "
"over the range."
msgstr "Posunout vstupní a výstupní černý a bílý bod a gamu mezi nimi, pro jednotlivé kanály nebo pro všechny. Vyrovnání rozprostře jas rovnoměrně přes rozsah."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:66
#: ui/dialogs/document/export_dialog.gd:310
msgid "Black"
msgstr "Černá"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:67
msgid ""
"Black point: the input level that comes out black. Everything below it is "
"clipped."
msgstr "Černý bod: vstupní úroveň, která vyjde černá. Vše pod ní je oříznuto."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:75
msgid "Midtone"
msgstr "Střední tón"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:76
msgid ""
"Midtone: the gamma, where mid grey sits. Above one lifts the midtones, below "
"one drops them, the ends stay put."
msgstr "Střední tón: gama, kde leží střední šeď. Nad jedna zvedá střední tóny, pod jedna je snižuje, konce zůstávají."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:84
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/add_noise_filter.gd:20
#: ui/dialogs/document/export_dialog.gd:308
#: ui/dockers/graph/graph_docker.gd:204
msgid "White"
msgstr "Bílá"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:85
msgid ""
"White point: the input level that comes out white. Everything above it is "
"clipped."
msgstr "Bílý bod: vstupní úroveň, která vyjde bílá. Vše nad ní je oříznuto."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:93
msgid "Output black"
msgstr "Výstupní černá"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:94
msgid ""
"Output black: the darkest the layer may come out, so raising it lifts the "
"blacks towards grey."
msgstr "Výstupní černá: nejtmavší, jak vrstva smí vyjít, takže její zvýšení zvedne černé k šedé."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:102
msgid "Output white"
msgstr "Výstupní bílá"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:103
msgid ""
"Output white: the brightest the layer may come out, so lowering it holds the "
"whites down."
msgstr "Výstupní bílá: nejjasnější, jak vrstva smí vyjít, takže její snížení drží bílé dole."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:116
msgid ""
"Which channel the handles move. Master moves red, green and blue together, a "
"single channel shifts the colour too, and Lightness (Oklab) moves lightness "
"alone."
msgstr "Který kanál úchyty posouvají. Hlavní posouvá červenou, zelenou a modrou společně, jediný kanál posouvá i barvu a Jas (Oklab) posouvá jen jas."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:131
msgid ""
"Spread the lightness evenly over the range, from the Oklab lightness "
"histogram of what this Levels reads: the layer, or for one on a group or the "
"whole document, what is composited under it. Chroma and hue stay as they "
"were, and the handles then move over the equalized levels."
msgstr "Rozprostřít jas rovnoměrně přes rozsah podle histogramu jasu Oklab toho, co tyto Úrovně čtou: vrstvy, nebo u Úrovní na skupině či celém dokumentu toho, co je pod nimi složeno. Sytost a odstín zůstanou, jak byly, a úchyty se pak pohybují nad vyrovnanými úrovněmi."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:135
msgid "Drop the Equalize map, so the handles act on the layer as painted."
msgstr "Zahodit mapu Vyrovnání, aby úchyty působily na vrstvu, jak je namalovaná."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:139
msgid ""
"Set black point: click a spot on the canvas that should come out black. "
"Escape puts the eyedropper away."
msgstr "Nastavit černý bod: klikněte na místo na plátně, které má vyjít černé. Escape kapátko odloží."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:145
msgid ""
"Set white point: click a spot on the canvas that should come out white. "
"Escape puts the eyedropper away."
msgstr "Nastavit bílý bod: klikněte na místo na plátně, které má vyjít bílé. Escape kapátko odloží."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:166
msgid "Equalized using Lightness (Oklab)"
msgstr "Vyrovnáno podle jasu (Oklab)"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:207
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_curves_panel.gd:49
msgid "Channel"
msgstr "Kanál"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:246
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_curves_panel.gd:65
