msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Obnovit"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:262
msgid "Input levels"
msgstr "Vstupní úrovně"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:263
msgid ""
"The range read from the layer, and the gamma between its black and its white."
msgstr "Rozsah čtený z vrstvy a gama mezi její černou a bílou."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:278
msgid ""
"Drag the black, grey and white handles to set the input range and the gamma."
msgstr "Táhněte černý, šedý a bílý úchyt pro nastavení vstupního rozsahu a gamy."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:287
msgid "Output levels"
msgstr "Výstupní úrovně"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:288
msgid ""
"The range the layer comes out in, after the handles above have set black and "
"white."
msgstr "Rozsah, ve kterém vrstva vyjde, poté co úchyty výše nastaví černou a bílou."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:292
msgid "Drag the two handles to set where black and white come out."
msgstr "Táhněte dva úchyty pro nastavení, kde vyjde černá a bílá."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/levels/sa_levels_panel.gd:799
msgid ""
"Nothing painted there for Levels to read, so the handles stay as they are."
msgstr "Tam není nic namalováno, co by Úrovně četly, takže úchyty zůstávají, jak jsou."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/local_contrast/local_contrast_filter.gd:80
msgid "Local Contrast"
msgstr "Místní kontrast"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/local_contrast/local_contrast_filter.gd:90
msgid ""
"Bring out detail at every scale and ease the wide steps between tones, with "
"no halo along a strong edge."
msgstr "Vytáhnout detail ve všech měřítcích a zmírnit široké skoky mezi tóny, bez svatozáře podél silné hrany."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_adjust_graph.gd:244
msgid ""
"How many pixels of this layer sit at each level, the input the filter reads, "
"before the handles."
msgstr "Kolik pixelů této vrstvy leží na každé úrovni, vstup, který filtr čte, před úchyty."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_adjust_graph.gd:246
msgid ""
"How many pixels of the group's composite sit at each level, before its "
"filters and the handles."
msgstr "Kolik pixelů složeniny skupiny leží na každé úrovni, před jejími filtry a úchyty."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_adjust_graph.gd:248
msgid ""
"How many pixels of the whole picture sit at each level, before the "
"document's filters and the handles."
msgstr "Kolik pixelů celého obrazu leží na každé úrovni, před filtry dokumentu a úchyty."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_adjust_graph.gd:250
msgid ""
"How many pixels of the picture under this adjustment layer sit at each "
"level, before the handles."
msgstr "Kolik pixelů obrazu pod touto vrstvou úprav leží na každé úrovni, před úchyty."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_adjust_graph.gd:251
msgid ""
"How many pixels of the active layer sit at each level, before the handles."
msgstr "Kolik pixelů aktivní vrstvy leží na každé úrovni, před úchyty."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_curves_panel.gd:66
msgid "Put every channel's curve back on the diagonal."
msgstr "Vrátit křivku každého kanálu na úhlopříčku."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_curves_panel.gd:78
msgid "Click to add a point, drag it off the graph to remove it."
msgstr "Klikněte pro přidání bodu, táhněte ho z grafu pro jeho odebrání."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_palette_panel.gd:36
#: modules/sara-base-modules/stats/saturation_by_value.gd:49
msgid "Shadows"
msgstr "Stíny"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_palette_panel.gd:37
#: modules/sara-base-modules/stats/saturation_by_value.gd:55
msgid "Midtones"
msgstr "Střední tóny"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_palette_panel.gd:38
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Světla"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_palette_panel.gd:39
msgid "Influence"
msgstr "Vliv"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_palette_panel.gd:96
msgid "Palette"
msgstr "Paleta"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_palette_panel.gd:103
msgid ""
"No colours yet. Click + to add one, or save swatches in the Colour Picker "
"docker and reopen this."
msgstr "Zatím žádné barvy. Klikněte na + a jednu přidejte, nebo uložte vzorky v panelu Výběr barvy a otevřete toto znovu."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_palette_panel.gd:173
msgid "Pick a colour to keep as a swatch."
msgstr "Vyberte barvu, kterou chcete uchovat jako vzorek."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_palette_panel.gd:205
msgid "Take the selected colour out of this filter. Your swatches keep it."
msgstr "Vyjmout vybranou barvu z tohoto filtru. Vaše vzorky si ji ponechají."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_palette_panel.gd:410
msgid "Bands of %s"
msgstr "Pásma barvy %s"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_palette_panel.gd:412
msgid "Click a colour to set its own bands."
msgstr "Klikněte na barvu a nastavte jí vlastní pásma."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_point_adjust.gd:42
msgid "Master"
msgstr "Hlavní"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_point_adjust.gd:46
msgid "Lightness (Oklab)"
msgstr "Jas (Oklab)"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/sa_point_adjust.gd:406
msgid ""
"%s wrote a value that is not a number, which draws black. Please report it "
"with the picture."
msgstr "%s zapsal hodnotu, která není číslo, a ta se kreslí černě. Nahlaste to prosím i s obrázkem."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/white_point/white_point_filter.gd:103
msgid "White Point"
msgstr "Bílý bod"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/white_point/white_point_filter.gd:116
msgid ""
"Sets the white balance: pick a colour that should be neutral, or let Auto "
"find it, and the cast it carries is taken out of the whole picture in linear "
"light."
msgstr "Nastavuje vyvážení bílé: vyberte barvu, která má být neutrální, nebo ji nechte najít automaticky, a nádech, který nese, se odstraní z celého obrazu v lineárním světle."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/white_point/white_point_panel.gd:36
msgid ""
"Pick a colour on the canvas that should be neutral grey, averaged over the "
"Eyedropper tool's Sample size. Click it again to put it away."
msgstr "Vyberte na plátně barvu, která má být neutrálně šedá, zprůměrovanou přes velikost vzorku nástroje Kapátko. Dalším kliknutím ji odložíte."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/white_point/white_point_panel.gd:35
msgid ""
"The colour picked or found, which the filter turns into a grey of its own "
"luminance."
msgstr "Vybraná nebo nalezená barva, kterou filtr převede na šedou o jejím vlastním jasu."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/white_point/white_point_panel.gd:36
msgid ""
"Find the cast in the whole picture, the way the choice beside it says, and "
"take it out."
msgstr "Najít nádech v celém obraze tak, jak říká volba vedle, a odstranit ho."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/white_point/white_point_panel.gd:37
msgid ""
"How Auto finds the cast: from the surfaces, whose colours it takes to "
"average to grey, or from the edges."
msgstr "Jak Automaticky najde nádech: z ploch, jejichž barvy bere tak, že se zprůměrují do šedé, nebo z hran."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/white_point/white_point_panel.gd:40
msgid ""
"Auto found nothing to read, every texel empty, too dark or clipped, so the "
"colour stays as it was."
msgstr "Automaticky nenašlo nic ke čtení, každý texel je prázdný, příliš tmavý nebo oříznutý, takže barva zůstává, jak byla."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/white_point/white_point_panel.gd:45
msgid "From edges"
msgstr "Z hran"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/white_point/white_point_panel.gd:45
msgid "From surfaces"
msgstr "Z ploch"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/white_point/white_point_panel.gd:47
msgid "Found %s from the surfaces. It becomes neutral grey at %.3f."
msgstr "Nalezeno %s z ploch. Stane se neutrální šedou na %.3f."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/white_point/white_point_panel.gd:48
msgid "Found %s from the edges. It becomes neutral grey at %.3f."
msgstr "Nalezeno %s z hran. Stane se neutrální šedou na %.3f."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/white_point/white_point_panel.gd:86
msgid "Neutral colour"
msgstr "Neutrální barva"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/white_point/white_point_panel.gd:103
msgid "Auto"
msgstr "Automaticky"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/white_point/white_point_panel.gd:149
msgid ""
"Nothing picked yet. Press the eyedropper and click a colour that should be "
"grey."
msgstr "Zatím nic nevybráno. Stiskněte kapátko a klikněte na barvu, která má být šedá."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/white_point/white_point_panel.gd:155
msgid ""
"Picked %s, too dark to set a white point by, so the document's white is kept."
msgstr "Vybráno %s, příliš tmavé na nastavení bílého bodu, takže bílá dokumentu se ponechává."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/white_point/white_point_panel.gd:162
msgid "Picked %s. It becomes neutral grey at %.3f."
msgstr "Vybráno %s. Stane se neutrální šedou na %.3f."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/filters/white_point/white_point_panel.gd:321
msgid ""
"Nothing painted there for White Point to read, so the colour stays as it was."
msgstr "Tam není nic namalováno, co by Bílý bod četl, takže barva zůstává, jak byla."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/gradient/sa_gradient_ends.gd:39
msgid "Foreground to Background"
msgstr "Popředí do pozadí"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/gradient/sa_gradient_ends.gd:40
msgid "Foreground to Transparent"
msgstr "Popředí do průhledna"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/gradient/state_gradient.gd:427
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/gradient/state_gradient.gd:467
msgid "gradient"
msgstr "přechod"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/liquify/sa_liquify.gd:58
msgid "Liquify"
msgstr "Zkapalnění"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/liquify/sa_liquify.gd:94
msgid ""
"Put liquify in hand with the liquify preset used last, Liquify Push before "
"any was."
msgstr "Vzít do ruky zkapalnění s naposledy použitým přednastavením zkapalnění, dříve Zkapalnění Tlačit."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/liquify/sa_liquify.gd:174
msgid ""
"What the brush does while you hold it down. Push drags the paint along, "
"Reconstruct restores it, Smooth straightens wobbly lines as a stabiliser "
"would, Twirl turns it the way Direction says (the other way with Alt), "
"Shrink pulls it towards the centre and Grow pushes it out (Alt swaps the "
"two)."
msgstr "Co štětec dělá, dokud ho držíte. Tlačit táhne barvu s sebou, Obnovit ji vrací, Vyhladit rovná roztřesené čáry jako stabilizátor, Vír ji točí, jak říká Směr (s Alt naopak), Zmenšit ji táhne ke středu a Zvětšit ji tlačí ven (Alt je prohodí)."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/liquify/sa_liquify.gd:191
msgid ""
"Which way Twirl turns the paint. Alt held turns it the other way. Dimmed "
"under the other modes."
msgstr "Kterým směrem Vír barvu točí. Držený Alt ji točí opačně. Ztlumeno v ostatních režimech."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/liquify/sa_liquify.gd:200
msgid "Width of the brush, in pixels."
msgstr "Šířka štětce v pixelech."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/liquify/sa_liquify.gd:209
msgid ""
"Strength of the effect at the brush centre. Press Enter to keep the result "
"as one undo step, or Escape to undo it all."
msgstr "Síla efektu ve středu štětce. Stiskněte Enter pro ponechání výsledku jako jednoho kroku zpět, nebo Escape pro zrušení všeho."

