#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/add_noise_filter.gd:29
msgid "Add Noise"
msgstr "Přidání šumu"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/add_noise_filter.gd:38
msgid ""
"Grain over the paint: white, random, a camera sensor's, or salt and pepper, "
"the same pattern for the same seed."
msgstr "Zrno přes barvu: bílé, náhodné, ze snímače fotoaparátu, nebo sůl a pepř, se stejným vzorem pro stejné semínko."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/bloom_filter.gd:29
msgid "Bloom"
msgstr "Záře"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/bloom_filter.gd:39
msgid ""
"Spread the values brighter than the threshold into a glow whose reach is the "
"radius, in pixels."
msgstr "Rozprostřít hodnoty jasnější než práh do záře, jejíž dosah je poloměr v pixelech."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/bump_map.gd:33
msgid "Bump Map"
msgstr "Reliéfní mapa"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/bump_map.gd:42
msgid ""
"Shade the layer's own colour by a light over its height: an azimuth round "
"the surface and an elevation above it."
msgstr "Stínovat vlastní barvu vrstvy světlem nad její výškou: azimut kolem povrchu a výška nad ním."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/chromatic_aberration_filter.gd:34
msgid "Chromatic Aberration"
msgstr "Chromatická vada"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/chromatic_aberration_filter.gd:43
msgid ""
"Part the red and the blue towards the picture's edges, as a lens that "
"focuses them apart does."
msgstr "Rozdělit červenou a modrou ke krajům obrazu, jako to dělá objektiv, který je zaostří odděleně."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/denoise_filter.gd:22
msgid "gaussian"
msgstr "gaussovské"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/denoise_filter.gd:26
msgid "Denoise"
msgstr "Odšumění"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/denoise_filter.gd:35
msgid ""
"Smooth the grain out of an area and leave its edges, by a Gaussian or a "
"plain average over a radius."
msgstr "Vyhladit zrno z plochy a zachovat její hrany, gaussovským nebo prostým průměrem přes poloměr."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/denoise_filter.gd:39
msgid "Gaussian"
msgstr "Gaussovo"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/denoise_filter.gd:39
msgid "Mean"
msgstr "Průměr"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/desaturate_filter.gd:32
msgid "Desaturate"
msgstr "Odbarvení"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/desaturate_filter.gd:42
msgid ""
"Take every colour to the grey of its own lightness. For part of the way, use "
"Hue/Saturation/Lightness."
msgstr "Převést každou barvu na šedou jejího vlastního jasu. Pro částečné odbarvení použijte Odstín/sytost/jas."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/dither_filter.gd:40
msgid "Bayer 8 × 8"
msgstr "Bayer 8 × 8"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/dither_filter.gd:40
msgid "Blue noise"
msgstr "Modrý šum"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/dither_filter.gd:40
msgid "Interleaved gradient noise"
msgstr "Prokládaný gradientní šum"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/dither_filter.gd:47
msgid "Document's encoding"
msgstr "Kódování dokumentu"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/dither_filter.gd:47
msgid "Gamma 2.2"
msgstr "Gama 2,2"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/dither_filter.gd:47
msgid "Gamma 3.0 (cube root)"
msgstr "Gama 3,0 (třetí odmocnina)"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/dither_filter.gd:47
msgid "Linear light"
msgstr "Lineární světlo"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/dither_filter.gd:68
msgid "Dither"
msgstr "Dither"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/dither_filter.gd:77
msgid ""
"Few levels per channel with a pattern between them, for a print or pixel-art "
"look. Always runs last."
msgstr "Málo úrovní na kanál se vzorem mezi nimi, pro vzhled tisku nebo pixel artu. Vždy běží poslední."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/drifting_noise_filter.gd:43
msgid "Drifting Noise"
msgstr "Unášený šum"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/drifting_noise_filter.gd:52
msgid ""
"A soft noise over the paint that drifts as its time plays, at the speed and "
"in the direction you set."
msgstr "Jemný šum přes barvu, který se unáší, jak plyne jeho čas, rychlostí a směrem, které nastavíte."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/edge_detection.gd:27
msgid "Edge Detection"
msgstr "Detekce hran"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/edge_detection.gd:36
msgid ""
"Show edges as grey lines, brightest where the image changes most sharply."
msgstr "Ukázat hrany jako šedé čáry, nejjasnější tam, kde se obraz mění nejostřeji."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/exposure_filter.gd:35
msgid "Stops"
msgstr "Stupně"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/exposure_filter.gd:50
msgid ""
"Move every value by stops of light, so +1 doubles it and -1 halves it. Hue "
"is kept, and values above white are kept too."
msgstr "Posunout každou hodnotu o stupně světla, takže +1 ji zdvojnásobí a -1 sníží na polovinu. Odstín se zachová a hodnoty nad bílou také."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/gaussian_blur_filter.gd:17
msgid "Gaussian Blur"
msgstr "Gaussovo rozostření"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/gaussian_blur_filter.gd:26
msgid ""
"Soften the picture with a bell-shaped blur whose reach is the radius, in "
"pixels."
msgstr "Změkčit obraz zvonovitým rozostřením, jehož dosah je poloměr v pixelech."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/grain_filter.gd:32
msgid "Monochrome"
msgstr "Jednobarevné"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/grain_filter.gd:40
msgid "monochrome"
msgstr "jednobarevné"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/grain_filter.gd:48
msgid "Grain"
msgstr "Zrno"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/grain_filter.gd:57
msgid ""
"A film's grain in clumps of the size you set, in the lightness alone or in "
"colour, the same for one seed."
msgstr "Filmové zrno ve shlucích nastavené velikosti, jen v jasu nebo barevně, stejné pro jedno semínko."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/high_pass_filter.gd:53
msgid "High Pass"
msgstr "Horní propust"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/high_pass_filter.gd:63
msgid ""
"Sharpen with the picture less its Gaussian blur, laid over the picture in "
"the Mode at the Amount. Show the raw map draws the detail alone around mid "
"grey."
msgstr "Zaostřit obrazem bez jeho gaussovského rozostření, položeným přes obraz v Režimu s Množstvím. Ukázat surovou mapu kreslí jen detail kolem střední šedi."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/hot_pixels_filter.gd:30
msgid "Hot Pixels"
msgstr "Horké pixely"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/hot_pixels_filter.gd:39
msgid ""
"Remove single pixels that stand apart from all their neighbours, and leave "
"every other pixel as it was."
msgstr "Odstranit samostatné pixely, které se liší od všech sousedů, a ostatní pixely nechat, jak byly."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/invert_filter.gd:32
msgid ""
"Turn every colour into its opposite, so black becomes white, with alpha left "
"where it was."
msgstr "Převést každou barvu na její opak, takže černá se stane bílou, a alfu nechat, kde byla."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/laplacian_filter.gd:42
msgid "Laplacian"
msgstr "Laplaceův filtr"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/laplacian_filter.gd:52
msgid ""
"Sharpen with the second derivative, its detail map laid over the picture in "
"Overlay at the Amount. Show the raw map draws the map alone around mid grey."
msgstr "Zaostřit druhou derivací, jejíž mapa detailu se položí přes obraz v Překrytí s Množstvím. Ukázat surovou mapu kreslí jen mapu kolem střední šedi."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/lens_blur_filter.gd:17
msgid "Lens Blur"
msgstr "Rozostření čočky"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/lens_blur_filter.gd:26
msgid ""
"Spread every pixel into a flat disc of the radius, the way an out-of-focus "
"lens does."
msgstr "Rozprostřít každý pixel do plochého disku o poloměru, jako to dělá rozostřený objektiv."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/lens_correction_filter.gd:62
msgid "Lens Correction"
msgstr "Korekce objektivu"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/lens_correction_filter.gd:72
msgid ""
"Straighten the lines a wide lens bowed: above nought a barrel's bulge, below "
"it a pincushion's pinch."
msgstr "Narovnat čáry, které široký objektiv prohnul: nad nulou vydutí soudku, pod ní sevření poduškou."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/lens_correction_filter.gd:153
msgid "Held at %s%%, the strongest correction a canvas this size allows."
msgstr "Drženo na %s%%, nejsilnější korekce, jakou plátno této velikosti dovolí."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/low_pass_filter.gd:20
msgid "Low Pass"
msgstr "Dolní propust"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/low_pass_filter.gd:30
msgid ""
"Keep the broad shapes and drop the fine detail. A Gaussian blur, under the "
"name used for frequency separation."
msgstr "Zachovat hrubé tvary a zahodit jemný detail. Gaussovo rozostření pod názvem, který se používá pro frekvenční separaci."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/lut_filter.gd:50
msgid "LUT"
msgstr "LUT"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/lut_filter.gd:59
msgid "Grade the picture with a colour lookup table from a .cube file."
msgstr "Barevně upravit obraz tabulkou z .cube souboru."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/lut_filter.gd:174
msgid "Load .cube file..."
msgstr "Načíst .cube soubor..."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/lut_filter.gd:174
msgid "Pick a .cube file and keep its table in this filter."
msgstr "Vybrat .cube soubor a uchovat jeho tabulku v tomto filtru."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/lut_filter.gd:213
msgid "%s, %d a side"
msgid_plural "%s, %d a side"
msgstr[0] "%s, %d na stranu"
msgstr[1] "%s, %d na stranu"
msgstr[2] "%s, %d na stranu"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/lut_filter.gd:213
msgid "No table loaded."
msgstr "Není načtena žádná tabulka."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/mirror_filter.gd:54
msgid "Mirror"
msgstr "Zrcadlení"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/mirror_filter.gd:70
msgid ""
"Reflect the picture about a line, the way still water reflects what stands "
"above it."
msgstr "Odrazit obraz podle přímky, jako klidná voda odráží, co stojí nad ní."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/motion_blur.gd:20
msgid "Motion Blur"
msgstr "Rozmazání pohybem"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/motion_blur.gd:29
msgid ""
"Smear the picture along a line at an angle, as if it moved while the shutter "
"was open."
msgstr "Rozmazat obraz podél přímky pod úhlem, jako by se pohnul, zatímco byla otevřená závěrka."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/normal_map.gd:33
msgid "Height to Normal Map"
msgstr "Výška na normálovou mapu"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/normal_map.gd:43
msgid ""
"Read a height as a surface: +X right, +Y up, +Z out, so a ramp rising "
"towards the top of the canvas reads green below 0.5. The normal is stored as "
"the colour it shows, so a flat surface is the lilac (128, 128, 255) on the "
"canvas and in an export."
msgstr "Číst výšku jako povrch: +X doprava, +Y nahoru, +Z ven, takže rampa stoupající k horní části plátna se pod 0,5 čte zeleně. Normála se ukládá jako barva, kterou ukazuje, takže rovný povrch je šeříková (128, 128, 255) na plátně i v exportu."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/opendrt_parameters.gd:66
msgid "Tonescale"
msgstr "Tónová stupnice"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/opendrt_parameters.gd:77
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/opendrt_parameters.gd:97
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/opendrt_parameters.gd:108
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/opendrt_parameters.gd:126
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/opendrt_parameters.gd:134
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/opendrt_parameters.gd:173
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/opendrt_parameters.gd:183
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/opendrt_parameters.gd:193
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/opendrt_parameters.gd:204
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/opendrt_parameters.gd:205
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/opendrt_parameters.gd:212
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/opendrt_parameters.gd:219
msgid "check"
msgstr "kontrola"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/opendrt_parameters.gd:112
msgid "Creative White"
msgstr "Tvůrčí bílá"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/opendrt_parameters.gd:120
msgid "Purity"
msgstr "Čistota"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/opendrt_parameters.gd:180
msgid "Brilliance"
msgstr "Brilance"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/opendrt_parameters.gd:201
msgid "Hue Shift"
msgstr "Posun odstínu"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/opendrt_parameters.gd:837
msgid "Look Preset"
msgstr "Přednastavení vzhledu"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/opendrt_parameters.gd:838
msgid "Tonescale Preset"
msgstr "Přednastavení tónové stupnice"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/pixelate_filter.gd:29
msgid "Pixelate"
msgstr "Pixelizace"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/pixelate_filter.gd:38
msgid ""
"Cut the picture into square blocks, each filled with the colour at its "
"centre."
msgstr "Rozřezat obraz na čtvercové bloky, každý vyplněný barvou ve svém středu."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/posterise_filter.gd:31
msgid "Posterize"
msgstr "Posterizace"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/posterise_filter.gd:46
msgid "Cut every channel to a few even levels, for flat bands of colour."
msgstr "Snížit každý kanál na několik rovnoměrných úrovní, pro plochá pásma barvy."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/red_eye_removal_filter.gd:36
msgid "Red-eye Removal"
msgstr "Odstranění červených očí"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/red_eye_removal_filter.gd:45
msgid ""
"Take the red out of red eyes in the selection, leaving skin alone, so a red "
"pupil turns a dark neutral."
msgstr "Odstranit červenou z červených očí ve výběru a kůži nechat, takže červená zornice zešedne do tmavé neutrální."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/sharpen_filter.gd:20
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/sharpen_filter.gd:31
msgid "Sharpen"
msgstr "Zaostření"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/sharpen_filter.gd:21
msgid "Unsharp mask"
msgstr "Maska neostrosti"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/sharpen_filter.gd:40
msgid "Sharpen edges, simply or with an unsharp mask."
msgstr "Zaostřit hrany, jednoduše nebo maskou neostrosti."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/tonemap_filter.gd:74
msgid "Tonemap"
msgstr "Mapování tónů"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/tonemap_filter.gd:84
msgid ""
"Bring the highlights above the knee under white with their hue held, as "
"Tonemap Highlights shows them, in the paint, or form the picture with "
"OpenDRT, which clips to the display's range as Resolve's does when Oklab hue "
"is off."
msgstr "Dostat světla nad kolenem pod bílou se zachovaným odstínem, jak je ukazuje Mapování tónů světel, do barvy, nebo vytvořit obraz pomocí OpenDRT, který ořezává na rozsah displeje jako Resolve, když je odstín Oklab vypnutý."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/tonemap_filter.gd:175
msgid "the OpenDRT parameter block could not be made."
msgstr "blok parametrů OpenDRT nešlo vytvořit."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/vignette_filter.gd:37
msgid "Vignette"
msgstr "Vinětace"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/vignette_filter.gd:46
msgid ""
"Darken the picture towards its edges, or brighten them with a negative "
"amount. Measured from the document's centre."
msgstr "Ztmavit obraz ke krajům, nebo je záporným množstvím zesvětlit. Měřeno od středu dokumentu."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/wavelet_denoise_filter.gd:31
msgid "Wavelet Denoise"
msgstr "Vlnkové odšumění"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/wavelet_denoise_filter.gd:40
msgid ""
"Take the grain out at several scales at once and keep the edges, finest "
"grain first."
msgstr "Odstranit zrno v několika měřítcích najednou a zachovat hrany, nejjemnější zrno nejdřív."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/wobble_filter.gd:22
msgid "Horizontal ripples"
msgstr "Vodorovné vlnky"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/wobble_filter.gd:22
msgid "Vertical ripples"
msgstr "Svislé vlnky"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/wobble_filter.gd:30
msgid "Wobble"
msgstr "Vlnění"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/wobble_filter.gd:39
msgid ""
"Ripple the picture sideways in waves a noise breaks up, the way a reflection "
"wobbles on water."
msgstr "Zvlnit obraz do stran ve vlnách, které rozbíjí šum, jako se chvěje odraz na vodě."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/wrap_offset.gd:39
msgid "Wrap Offset"
msgstr "Posun s přetečením"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/base/usual/wrap_offset.gd:54
msgid ""
"Shift the whole canvas round on itself, so what leaves one edge comes back "
"at the other, for painting a tile's seam."
msgstr "Posunout celé plátno samo kolem sebe, takže co opustí jeden okraj, vrátí se na druhém, pro malování švu dlaždice."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/filter-brush/filter_brush_stroke.gd:107
msgid ""
"No installed module offers the filter %s, so the Filter Brush paints nothing."
msgstr "Žádný nainstalovaný modul nenabízí filtr %s, takže Štětec filtru nic nemaluje."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/filter-brush/filter_brush_stroke.gd:113
msgid "%s cannot run, so the Filter Brush paints nothing. %s"
msgstr "%s nemůže běžet, takže Štětec filtru nic nemaluje. %s"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/filter-brush/filter_brush_stroke.gd:116
msgid ""
"%s says a brush cannot paint it, so the Filter Brush paints nothing. Choose "
"another filter."
msgstr "%s říká, že ho štětec malovat nemůže, takže Štětec filtru nic nemaluje. Vyberte jiný filtr."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/filter-brush/filter_brush_stroke.gd:127
msgid ""
"%s records no pass the Filter Brush can run, so the brush cannot paint it."
msgstr "%s nezaznamenává žádný průchod, který by Štětec filtru mohl spustit, takže ho štětec malovat nemůže."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/filter-brush/filter_brush_stroke.gd:130
msgid ""
"%s reads the whole layer for every pixel, which a brush cannot paint. Choose "
"another filter."
msgstr "%s čte pro každý pixel celou vrstvu, což štětec malovat nemůže. Vyberte jiný filtr."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/filter-brush/module.gd:82
msgid "Filter Brush"
msgstr "Štětec filtru"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/filter-brush/module.gd:130
msgid ""
"The filter the brush paints. Its result is laid where the brush passes, as "
"much as the opacity says."
msgstr "Filtr, který štětec maluje. Jeho výsledek se položí tam, kudy štětec projde, tolik, kolik říká krytí."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/filter-brush/module.gd:150
#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/module.gd:260
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/module.gd:218
msgid ""
"Brush radius in pixels of this document (the stroke is twice this wide). "
"Double-click to type a value, and Left or Right steps it by 1 pixel."
msgstr "Poloměr štětce v pixelech tohoto dokumentu (tah je dvakrát širší). Dvojklikem napíšete hodnotu, šipky vlevo a vpravo ji posunou o 1 pixel."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/filter-brush/module.gd:165
msgid ""
"The stroke's strength over the filter's result: how much of it the stroke "
"lays, at 100% the result whole. The filter's own settings, a blur's radius "
"among them, are the rows under Filter. Crossing the stroke again takes it no "
"further."
msgstr "Síla tahu nad výsledkem filtru: kolik z něj tah položí, při 100% celý výsledek. Vlastní nastavení filtru, mezi nimi poloměr rozostření, jsou řádky pod Filtrem. Další přejetí tahu ho dál neposílí."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/filter-brush/module.gd:176
msgid "How much of the radius the edge fades over. 0 is a hard edge."
msgstr "Jak velkou částí poloměru se okraj vytrácí. 0 je ostrý okraj."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
