msgstr "%d dalších nástrojů"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/stats/session_numbers.gd:181
msgid "%d other layers"
msgstr "%d dalších vrstev"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/stats/session_numbers.gd:208
msgid "Not named"
msgstr "Bez jména"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/stats/stats_docker.gd:78
msgid ""
"Computes the numbers each time you stop painting for the Idle after time on "
"the Performance page, and as often as the Graph docker draws while it is "
"open. Off, nothing is computed."
msgstr "Spočítá čísla pokaždé, když přestanete malovat na dobu Nečinnost po na stránce Výkon, a tak často, jak panel Graf kreslí, když je otevřený. Vypnuto, nic se nepočítá."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/stats/stats_docker.gd:137
#: modules/sara-base-modules/stats/stats_docker.gd:146
msgid "Stats"
msgstr "Statistiky"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/stats/stats_docker.gd:207
msgid "Not computed yet. The numbers come the next time you stop painting."
msgstr "Zatím nespočítáno. Čísla přijdou, až příště přestanete malovat."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/stats/stats_docker.gd:208
msgid "Computed at %s."
msgstr "Spočítáno v %s."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/stats/value_groups.gd:59
msgid ""
"Groups are the peaks of a histogram of Oklab lightness in 64 steps, smoothed "
"over five. Two peaks are two groups while the histogram between them falls "
"below half the lower peak. A group under one per cent of the canvas joins "
"its neighbour, and at most eight are named. Canvas nothing covers counts as "
"the background it shows."
msgstr "Skupiny jsou vrcholy histogramu jasu Oklab v 64 krocích, vyhlazeného přes pět. Dva vrcholy jsou dvě skupiny, pokud histogram mezi nimi klesne pod polovinu nižšího vrcholu. Skupina pod jedním procentem plátna se připojí k sousední a jmenuje se nejvýše osm. Plátno, které nic nepokrývá, se počítá jako pozadí, které ukazuje."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-base-modules/stats/value_groups.gd:346
msgid "Value %s"
msgstr "Hodnota %s"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/field_kernel/noise_own_field.gd:120
msgid "%s has no line '%s' to build it in at."
msgstr "%s nemá řádek '%s', na kterém by se to dalo sestavit."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/field_kernel/noise_own_field.gd:129
msgid "%s cannot be written (%s)."
msgstr "%s nelze zapsat (%s)."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/field_kernel/noise_own_field.gd:138
msgid "its pass does not compile: %s"
msgstr "jeho průchod nejde přeložit: %s"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/field_kernel/noise_own_field.gd:146
msgid "The noise brush passes over the brush field '%s', since %s"
msgstr "Šumový štětec vynechává pole štětce '%s', protože %s"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/module.gd:152
msgid "Noise Brush"
msgstr "Šumový štětec"

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/module.gd:232
msgid ""
"How opaque the stroke gets. It reaches this and stops, however often the "
"stroke crosses itself."
msgstr "Jak krycí tah bude. Dosáhne toho a zastaví se, ať se tah kříží kolikrát chce."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/module.gd:241
msgid ""
"How sharp the edge of the holes the texture leaves is. Low fades paint in "
"around them and thins the grain towards the stroke's edge."
msgstr "Jak ostrý je okraj děr, které textura nechá. Nízká hodnota kolem nich barvu prolíná a ztenčuje zrno k okraji tahu."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/module.gd:246
msgid ""
"What the stroke paints through: a grain, streaks along the stroke, or a "
"pattern."
msgstr "Čím tah maluje: zrno, šmouhy podél tahu, nebo vzor."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/module.gd:254
msgid ""
"Shifts the texture against the pressure. Above 0 paint needs a firmer press, "
"below 0 a lighter one."
msgstr "Posouvá texturu vůči přítlaku. Nad 0 barva potřebuje silnější přítlak, pod 0 slabší."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/module.gd:261
msgid ""
"0 paints the same texture and the same random values every stroke. Above 0 "
"each stroke gets its own."
msgstr "0 maluje stejnou texturu a stejné náhodné hodnoty každým tahem. Nad 0 dostane každý tah vlastní."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/module.gd:267
msgid ""
"How much paint the stroke lays in height where the texture is light. Nought "
"lays none."
msgstr "Kolik barvy do výšky tah položí tam, kde je textura světlá. Nula nepoloží žádnou."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/module.gd:274
msgid ""
"How much more impasto a leaning pen lays on the side it leans to, and less "
"on the other. Below 0 the other side lays more. An upright pen lays it "
"evenly."
msgstr "O kolik víc impasta nakloněné pero položí na stranu, kam se naklání, a o kolik méně na druhou. Pod 0 pokládá víc druhá strana. Svislé pero ho pokládá rovnoměrně."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/module.gd:282
msgid ""
"Pushes the colour of the paint on the layers below along with the stroke, as "
"far as that paint stands in height. Off pushes only this layer's paint. The "
"Background and the paper are never pushed."
msgstr "Tlačí barvu na vrstvách pod sebou spolu s tahem, tak daleko, jak vysoko ta barva stojí. Vypnuto tlačí jen barvu této vrstvy. Pozadí a papír se nikdy netlačí."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/module.gd:305
msgid ""
"How far the colour's hue and saturation follow the texture under each dab."
msgstr "Jak daleko odstín a sytost barvy sledují texturu pod každým otiskem."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/module.gd:406
msgid ""
"One paints colour only. Two also paints impasto, as much as Thickness lays."
msgstr "Jedna maluje jen barvu. Dvě maluje i impasto, tolik, kolik položí Tloušťka."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/module.gd:412
msgid "How closely the impasto follows the texture's second channel."
msgstr "Jak těsně impasto sleduje druhý kanál textury."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/module.gd:435
msgid ""
"How far the texture slides with the brush. 0 holds it still, 100% drags it "
"so streaks run the whole way."
msgstr "Jak daleko textura klouže se štětcem. 0 ji drží na místě, 100% ji táhne, takže šmouhy vedou celou cestu."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/noise_fields.gd:327
msgid "How wide one speck of the grain is, in pixels of the document."
msgstr "Jak široké je jedno zrnko zrna, v pixelech dokumentu."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/noise_fields.gd:330
msgid ""
"How far the grain is stretched about its middle. Low is a soft haze of "
"specks, high a hard pepper."
msgstr "Jak daleko je zrno roztaženo kolem svého středu. Nízká hodnota je měkký opar zrnek, vysoká tvrdý pepř."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/noise_fields.gd:338
msgid "How many streaks lie across the stroke."
msgstr "Kolik šmouh leží napříč tahem."

#. machine draft, not reviewed
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/noise_fields.gd:342
msgid ""
"How far each streak strays across the stroke from an even comb. 0 lays them "
